  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Interpeace/IRDP Rwanda Peace Building Prog 2012-15</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Interpeace/IRDP Rwanda fredsbyggande prog 2012-15</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med Institute of Research and Dialogue for Peace (IRDP) och    Interpeace program &#xe4;r att bidra till Rwandas f&#xf6;rsonings-,             &#xe5;teruppbyggnads- och demokratiseringsprocess genom att facilitera     dialog kring centrala fr&#xe5;gor om fred och s&#xe4;kerhet. Detta utg&#xf6;r fas IV i programmet (2012-2015). Sida finansierade de fyra tidigare faserna.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the IRDP/Interpeace peace-building programme is to     contribute to Rwanda&apos;s reconciliation, reconstruction and             democratisation process by facilitating dialogue around key issues of peace and conflict. This constitute phase V of the programme          (2012-2015). Sida financed the four previous programme phases.</narrative>
  </description>
